  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 305.11 Discharge Request Submission, Processing, and Approvals: EPA-Approved Pretreatment POTW",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 305.11 Discharge Request Submission, Processing, and Approvals: EPA-Approved Pretreatment POTW. Any person proposing to discharge wastewater to an EPA-approved pretreatment POTW, namely Claremont, Concord, Derry, Dover, Jaffrey, Keene, Manchester, Merrimack, Milford, Nashua, Rochester, Somersworth, or WRBP, shall comply with the applicable requirements of the respective POTW per 40 CFR Part 403.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Wq 305) #10381, eff 8-1-13; ss by #13241, eff 7-24-21",
